{"id":"wb-6-89","name":"递铺城址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"安吉古城遗址","text":"递铺城址位于浙江省安吉县安城镇西北5公里的古城村。古城平面呈方形，面积约0.33平方公里。目前保存有夯筑城墙的遗址，残高5到9米。2006年5月25日，列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。2013年6月9日，浙江省文物局公布其为第一批省级考古遗址公园","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%89%E5%90%89%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":87397940,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87397940","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d882127246bd8a4c9267bddd.jpg","title":"安吉古城及墓葬,_2022-02-20_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%89%E5%90%89%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%8F%8A%E5%A2%93%E8%91%AC,_2022-02-20_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/%E5%AE%89%E5%90%89%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%8F%8A%E5%A2%93%E8%91%AC%2C_2022-02-20_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​安吉古城遗址","width":320,"height":214}}